    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56400" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ο</span>, 
