		 and poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖνος</span>.
			Adv.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνως</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, 
