		 and poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενός</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεινόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενόω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κεῖος</span></b> , 
